 "problem": "Test code frequently relies on transitive includes or standard `<cassert>` for assertions, causing ambiguity over whether `NDEBUG` can disable assertions. Furthermore, direct includes are missing for `Assert`/`assert`, which impedes Include-What-You-Use (IWYU) tooling and causes compilation failures when assertions in `util/check.h` are disabled.",
